{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "58106cd720826966354eae08b86580b6c101758e8008e78e60d5bf74793050eb", "ja": "Astro歌謡祭以降、注目度の上がった\n『I.V.』はTV番組に出演。トークコーナーで\n独特の反応をするクロエに、会場は大いに\n沸く。だが本人には面白いことを言った\n自覚はなく、藍に「変人」と言われて驚く。", "zh": "自从Astro歌谣祭后，关注度有所上升的\n“I.V.”出演了电视节目。脱口秀环节中\n克洛伊独特的反应，让现场气氛十分\n高涨。但她本人却没有说了趣事的\n自觉，被蓝说成是“怪人”后大吃一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "63de0a3f989e70281ae2f9720c91612d98963e6c4ff49680aa67c71f90a6c74c", "ja": "（第五幕。新生I.V.は、かつてI.V.が新人賞を\n獲った、Astro歌謡祭でチーム別の審査を受ける）", "zh": "（第五幕。新生I.V.在曾经获得新人奖的Astro歌谣祭上接受分组评审）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0320fdbf59686377f67d84563b01e6dd844b11b45a51c4ab241511748a995859", "ja": "（物語の中心は、三船なる。真珠星は彼女にとって、\n様々な意味で、脅威となりつつあった）", "zh": "（故事的中心是三船なる。对她来说，真珠星正在逐渐成为各方面的威胁）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "65ca99786f206496547d70a8a6dbbe15e453d896370c4fc477a8f8033b67d7be", "ja": "（『Vermilion Red』として新人賞を獲るため、\nなるは得意の演技によって、真珠星を出し抜く）", "zh": "（为了以《Vermilion Red》的名义获得新人奖，奈留凭借自己擅长的演技，成功智胜了真珠星）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "187fd7bdf2fea04fde4effb87acaba38332f52d28b6fa12b8814d6bddd5f8292", "ja": "（トップを目指すアイドル達の、覚悟と決意。\n次に語られるのは……）", "zh": "（以顶级偶像为目标的大家所抱持的觉悟与决心。\n接下来要讲述的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "214ba4a659e115f6898681b093c5bdd141b7166598f71b10a75a4e560cad1bc6", "ja": "今日は音楽番組へのゲスト出演よ。\nトークコーナーもあるから、台本をよく読んでおいて。", "zh": "今天要作为嘉宾参加音乐节目。\n因为还有谈话环节，记得好好读一下台本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "577aaa2925a564e9511a7121c8bd5bb424391f9a0684f90b63a9397d1ebaa259", "ja": "Astro歌謡祭以降、『I.V.』の注目度は\nどんどん高くなってる……。", "zh": "自从Astro歌谣祭之后，“I.V.”的受关注度\n就在不断上升……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "ea55672ea6268604d04a9922b5b47e8b6c8bb684acf20eebf9f448430ace2474", "ja": "特に『Vermilion Red』のふたりはね。\n失敗なんて許されないから。", "zh": "尤其是『Vermilion Red』的两个人。\n因为绝对不能失败。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "50a23ce3aedc0dcb79fef91d572a4e5a78e2c0351d0916c5a29c6ba8abf640fc", "ja": "は、はいっ！\nさすがに、ちょっと緊張しちゃうな……。", "zh": "是、是！\n果然还是会有点紧张呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "14837b1c0b7f5ba45f72fd2ee7276334091a3d362276e8e69d5b22cb87ae6349", "ja": "失敗？\n誰にものを言ってるんだ。", "zh": "失败？\n你以为你在跟谁说话啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "11e6047a897efa74151d5200c0af1d9b19f79ea9c9cf11a8f82795780872339f", "ja": "音楽番組だろ、わかりやすいじゃないか。\nクオリティで黙らせればいいだけだ。", "zh": "是音乐节目吧，很好理解。只要用实力让他们闭嘴就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e28650b21b62593800b07a6f8b63b7aea6a4cf06297b4e5186ab46c25b07f7dd", "ja": "あの……私は？", "zh": "那个……那我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "956b76438a474c76395f74b01cfb3239fc5c5f3f91cb266e93d6276e166351f7", "ja": "真珠星は……今のところ学園ドラマで、迷演技を\n披露したド新人ってだけだから。まあ気楽に。", "zh": "珍珠星……目前也只是个在校园剧里秀了番糟糕演技的超级新人而已。所以，放轻松点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "062e0a2fd627801a5c094bf70315822528dbf617313ce86a1819fffe87c5dc5c", "ja": "なんでよっ！？", "zh": "为什么呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1015_mc", "source_sha256": "972af66fe814deb6744ab1c39623e2528093873a4052997f84a95f02e53d37bb", "ja": "注目はやはり、『Vermilion Red』のおふたり！\n息の合ったダンスが魅力でしたね～。", "zh": "最受瞩目的果然还是『Vermilion Red』的两位！\n配合默契的舞蹈真是魅力十足呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "125720e1f6909112b49f1bdeee27b327cdc9d584eb03f5ea46f55c276d5d945c", "ja": "ありがとうございます……！\n私は、付いていくので精一杯でしたけど……。", "zh": "谢谢……！\n我只是拼尽全力跟上她而已……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fe7374cdf8424a66b07bc63ae1fdecd4489882f719e38fcc3c9bc9e4b482e486", "ja": "自分たちのパフォーマンスを\n最大限引き出した、それだけです。", "zh": "只是将我们自己的表演发挥到了最大限度，仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1018_mc", "source_sha256": "3938818ae862e6eceaad911e14e3824465ee33b9e4f225a19032496c28479a05", "ja": "クールですね～。でも、今回はそんなクロエさんの\nパーソナルな一面もうかがいたいと思います。", "zh": "真酷啊～不过这次也想了解一下克洛伊小姐私下的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1019_mc", "source_sha256": "86b7538e03e05c370101d15fc65045223db8e4e00c8f80e5b1cdb86d1772a192", "ja": "基本中の基本ですが、\nクロエさんの好きな食べ物は？", "zh": "这是最基本的问题，\n克洛艾小姐喜欢的食物是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "29f358aaa9f8ca7e4344c237ae9b92a4fc672def45fb0bbb845a7a4d6b7ed44a", "ja": "好きな……。\n水。", "zh": "喜欢的……。\n水。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "41a1a50b8209fb0033bfe34c81c1957629f363ed2b1226505f9e49a808f66179", "ja": "水……？　あの、クロエさん、\n飲み物じゃなくて食べ物……。", "zh": "水……？那个，克洛艾小姐，我说的不是饮料，是食物……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "88ee7c1861585a588031be6572262ecdc4edbc546a41d34782856a7df3250e95", "ja": "食べ物は冷凍で宅配されるやつだから。\nコースもお任せだし、味とかどうでもいい。", "zh": "食物会冷冻后送过来。套餐也交给他们安排，味道什么的无所谓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0cf190efdc9faf057c3bd03539aec6f0d84a19a515593f9e88db1bd5fe2d6850", "ja": "自分から進んで口にするものなんて\n水くらいだし。だから、水。", "zh": "我会主动吃进嘴里的东西，也就只有水了。所以，就水吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "775ee016395c678773fcf9024b4a6543820a4deae8762fa8658b057863ec6a3c", "ja": "もっと話の広がりそうな……！　あ、ほら！\n私がレッスンの時にあげた塩飴とか……。", "zh": "能让话题延展开来的……！啊，你看！\n比如我上课时给你的盐糖之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "edcb992370e3ee237ded2f2d5b2aeb7cdb81b7ec079d9f98a4da83af60c2d131", "ja": "ああ。\n私、あれは嫌い。", "zh": "啊，我不喜欢那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "08a44ccf16cbc9319a5978d9d3d237692eff225899a32c46675b354077277d8d", "ja": "えーっ！？", "zh": "咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1027_audience", "source_sha256": "658ee7c10a9fee929a78a5ceeff3bff8c76445d739c82db03abbb0ec3a460529", "ja": "ワハハハハハッ！！！", "zh": "哇哈哈哈哈哈！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1028_mc", "source_sha256": "a17d56cbd048be261a810b706868260aa1eea3668ba0e7f217db9d68c68ad7a6", "ja": "クールというか何というか……\nクロエさんの、意外な一面を覗けましたね！", "zh": "该说是酷，还是怎么说呢……\n能窥见克洛伊小姐意外的一面呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "6c6657246235f64a4621c458ac8e29866dece7172888975890c6279b8d2edbcb", "ja": "うう……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1031_null", "source_sha256": "80c3925b1b7dde72895b54468fcc1b119f4dff637abea1611cc1628b02cd84e0", "ja": "番組終了後……", "zh": "节目结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "f4461dbae580ca7d91165b7d6552ac29e6e6a83d855168465056f8e9d3880cd2", "ja": "トークで、クロエがああいう受け方するとはね。\n意外だったわ。", "zh": "没想到克洛伊会在谈话中那样接话。\n真是出乎意料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "62f215f7d46184d33501a6de292359d8055e990775da9bbb75f998c9e0f9c17f", "ja": "受けてるのか？　あれは。", "zh": "那样算接住了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1034_035hin", "source_sha256": "187a97b4e118f0323cd4c3e3b022b69b4af6d14ee38b92739bed84e6a3b95e4f", "ja": "現場はだいぶ温まったかなって。\n受けてましたよ……塩飴。", "zh": "我想着，现场气氛应该已经热起来了吧。  \n确实收到了哦……盐糖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27198fde8ee7a0adba701a8d203522d82551214ac4abe9d5a79fc58f9ca65230", "ja": "受けてる自覚、なかったんだ……。", "zh": "原来你都没意识到自己很受欢迎啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "195108272a7bd39e37d4caf5346644305e300cf4ca9cc7d4f285249db38100ad", "ja": "まあ好評に越したことはないわ。\n今度は、例の学園ドラマから追加オファーよ。", "zh": "不过受到好评总是好事。\n这次，那部校园剧又发来追加邀约了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0353_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0353_story_01_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "019ef6529c930c2115d26cb39b29beacc0c901f2a8f8df0cf8f6402eddc3fc18", "ja": "今度はゲストではなく、レギュラー出演。\nはりきって挑みましょう。", "zh": "这次不是客串，而是固定出演。\n让我们拿出干劲迎接挑战吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
